{"id":"n65248-8-7","stage":4,"title":"슬슬 · 轻而易举地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65248-8-7-1","ko":"언제 목도리를 이렇게 많이 떴어?","zh":"你什么时候把围巾织了这么长？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"목도리를","meaning":"围巾","explanation":"목도리：围巾；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"목도리","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"55854","senseId":"1","lemma":"목도리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떴어?","meaning":"织，打","explanation":"뜨다：织，打；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"뜨다","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"53951","senseId":"1","lemma":"뜨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不知道的某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"634f23a72357e402","term":"목도리","zh":"围巾","audio":"/audio/634f23a72357e4022c83.mp3","entryId":"55854","definition":"为了抵御寒冷而围在脖子上的用品。","pronunciation":["목또리"]},{"id":"c2f95cfd19c5a89b","term":"이렇다","zh":"这样","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3","entryId":"71157","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["이러타"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"83c29e672f4ac6fe","term":"뜨다","zh":"织，打","audio":"/audio/83c29e672f4ac6fe6fc4.mp3","entryId":"53951","definition":"用线或绳等编做成衣服或网。","pronunciation":["뜨다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7e1b2d5d960ceb697cc9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65248-8-7-2","ko":"심심할 때 슬슬 했는데 금방 길어졌어.","zh":"闲着时慢慢织的，很快就长了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"심심할","meaning":"无聊","explanation":"심심하다：无聊；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"심심하다","audio":"/audio/3fc3b6b7d32bb06de335.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16445","senseId":"1","lemma":"심심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"슬슬","meaning":"轻而易举地","explanation":"슬슬：轻而易举地","readings":[{"term":"슬슬","audio":"/audio/bf84f69b6236f414244f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65248","senseId":"8","lemma":"슬슬","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했는데","meaning":"做（这里承接前文，指织围巾）","explanation":"하다：做（这里承接前文，指织围巾）；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"금방","meaning":"马上，立刻，立马","explanation":"금방：马上，立刻，立马","readings":[{"term":"금방","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34764","senseId":"3","lemma":"금방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"길어졌어.","meaning":"长，久；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"길다：长，久；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"길다","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26808","senseId":"2","lemma":"길다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3fc3b6b7d32bb06d","term":"심심하다","zh":"无聊","audio":"/audio/3fc3b6b7d32bb06de335.mp3","entryId":"16445","definition":"没有可做的事，没有意思，很乏味。","pronunciation":["심심하다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"bf84f69b6236f414","term":"슬슬","zh":"轻而易举地","audio":"/audio/bf84f69b6236f414244f.mp3","entryId":"65248","definition":"不费劲，很容易的样子。","pronunciation":["슬슬"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做（这里承接前文，指织围巾）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做（这里承接前文，指织围巾）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"08c341712591f51e","term":"금방","zh":"马上，立刻，立马","audio":"/audio/08c341712591f51e062b.mp3","entryId":"34764","definition":"时间过去不久，很快。","pronunciation":["금방"]},{"id":"013e520a738e476f","term":"길다","zh":"长，久","audio":"/audio/013e520a738e476f5fd9.mp3","entryId":"26808","definition":"从一个时间到另一个时间相隔甚远。","pronunciation":["길ː다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f89f7d6368f261e2261d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.677,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=65248","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"8","sourceLevel":"고급","day":128,"sequenceScore":2.4023,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["闲着时慢慢织的，很快就长了。","那个人好像是没见过的演员吧？演技有点差啊。","你什么时候把围巾织了这么长？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["闲着时慢慢织的，很快就长了。","你什么时候把围巾织了这么长？","那个人好像是没见过的演员吧？演技有点差啊。"],"answer":0}]}
